    "label": "Bode图频域指标",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For the Bode plot of G_c(jω)G(jω): 1. For relative stability, the loop gain must have not more than a -20-dB/decade slope at or near the crossover frequency ω_c. 2. Steady-state accuracy and measurement noise rejection achieved by the low gain at high frequency. 3. Disturbance rejection by a high gain over low frequencies. 4. Accuracy over a bandwidth ω_B, by maintaining the loop gain above a prescribed level.",
